      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "勉強も運動も特別なところはなく……\r\nなんならちょっとどんくさいぐらいです",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "みんなの前では、いつだってベストなパフォーマンスを\r\n見てもらうんだ、の気持ちでいますが──",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私のマックスは、きっと他の誰かの普通だったりします",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──でも",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そんな私が、ここでだけは特別になれる\r\nごくごく普通の私のままで、特別になれるんです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "みんなの前で、\r\n果穂と樹里ちゃんと凛世ちゃんと夏葉ちゃんと一緒に",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "こうして、アイドルをやっている時だけは──\r\nみんなの力で、特別に、してもらってるんです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──だから！\r\n私も、特別な時間をお約束します！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私を見て、私の歌を聴いて、私のことを考えている間は！\r\nみんなの時間を、特別なものにしちゃいます！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "楽しくて、ドキドキして、終わってほしくなくて、\r\n夢中になっちゃうような──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そんなチョコアイドルの甘さに、浸っちゃってくださいっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601000402/6010004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6010004020130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "まだまだ飛ばしていきましょう──！",
